msgid "How to install Windows qubes in Qubes OS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows.rst:6
#: 775bc750374543d4a7a78fc36803a900
msgid ""
"You can install Windows just like any other OS as an :doc:`HVM </user/"
"advanced-topics/standalones-and-hvms>`, if you just want something simple "
"and you can live without some features. This works for Windows XP, 7, 8, "
"8.1, 10, and 11."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows.rst:8
#: dc8f7174f6f648d3a44c6e7ef0038871
msgid ""
"Please keep in mind that Qubes Windows Tools are not supported on Windows "
"XP. Windows 8.1 may work comparable to Windows 10, but this has not been "
"tested, as this system is no longer supported and probably has no "
"significance anymore."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows.rst:10
#: 1447e309eb8c46bd8766827a02849f12
